                <p><strong>Challenge:</strong> Coordinating structural wall removal, basement conversion, and exterior work as a single integrated project — while maintaining quality across every trade simultaneously — required tight planning and a crew capable of handling structural carpentry, tile, finish work, and exterior construction without subcontracting any portion.</p>
                <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> A completely transformed home — from cramped, compartmentalized rooms to an open, finished, move-in-ready residence with expanded living area above and below grade and a renovated exterior. All work handled in-house by the ProBrothers team.</p>
